[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1862.87, "timestamp": "00:31:02", "text": "弾薬。何てことだ。弾薬をくれ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1865.19, "timestamp": "00:31:05", "text": "みんな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1866.789, "timestamp": "00:31:06", "text": "とどめを刺しに行く。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1869.99, "timestamp": "00:31:09", "text": "殺害。とどめを刺しに行く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1872.47, "timestamp": "00:31:12", "text": "それでおしまい。それでいいよ。ああ、君は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1875.029, "timestamp": "00:31:15", "text": "ジャック？狙撃手が欲しいのか？スナイピー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1877.59, "timestamp": "00:31:17", "text": "ねえ、知ってる？ちなみに、SKは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1879.75, "timestamp": "00:31:19", "text": "ちなみに、ずっと良くなったよ。 SKの方が良い。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1881.178, "timestamp": "00:31:21", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hewwo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1883.51, "timestamp": "00:31:23", "text": "うん。うん。スコープを置いた"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1885.165, "timestamp": "00:31:25", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "we starting in a bit"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1887.43, "timestamp": "00:31:27", "text": "それを装着すれば準備完了です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1890.47, "timestamp": "00:31:30", "text": "わかった。私は一生懸命頑張っています。しないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1894.149, "timestamp": "00:31:34", "text": "それについて心配してください。誰かが私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1896.63, "timestamp": "00:31:36", "text": "位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1898.87, "timestamp": "00:31:38", "text": "分かってるよ、ウェイン。あなたはとても怖がっています、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1902.149, "timestamp": "00:31:42", "text": "右？とても怖い。あなたは彼を殺したい"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1903.321, "timestamp": "00:31:43", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rN